      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HIGH PRAYER (1) goes very well at the course and distance with two wins and a placing from five starts. In the money last time at this track (23.72) in a Grade 5, finishing a 4 length third. Looks the one to beat with even luck. FIERY WORDS (2) box seated before sticking on well to finish 4.5 lengths away in second (20.03) at Capalaba in a Grade 5 over 366m. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. VELOCITY MIRANDA (6) has been racing well lately, making it two on end when saluting at this track last time over 407m in (24.08). Some good form is emerging from her last run. Hard to fault her form and she makes plenty of appeal. CANYA GOLD (7) cannot be ruled out.",
